    "detailed_description": "A straight forward challenge with minimal gimmicks and thrills, A Sleeper's Quest: A Labyrinth to Thee awaits your attempt. <br><br>Welcome to The Cradle, where a Trail called, &quot;The Sleeper Quest&quot; resides between reality and dreams. The Sleeper must find The Dream to complete The Sleeper Quest, which is a test of ones patience, dedication and memory. <br><br>Do you have what it takes to find the exit?<br><br><strong><br>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Test yourself in a mysterious labyrinth.<br> </li><li> Challenging, but simple FPS 3D Platforming.<br> </li><li> Save your location within the Labyrinth using checkpoints.<br> </li><li> Uncover and survive challenges while trying to find where The Dream lies.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "A straight forward challenge with minimal gimmicks and thrills, A Sleeper's Quest: A Labyrinth to Thee awaits your attempt. <br><br>Welcome to The Cradle, where a Trail called, &quot;The Sleeper Quest&quot; resides between reality and dreams. The Sleeper must find The Dream to complete The Sleeper Quest, which is a test of ones patience, dedication and memory. <br><br>Do you have what it takes to find the exit?<br><br><strong><br>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"> <li> Test yourself in a mysterious labyrinth.<br> </li><li> Challenging, but simple FPS 3D Platforming.<br> </li><li> Save your location within the Labyrinth using checkpoints.<br> </li><li> Uncover and survive challenges while trying to find where The Dream lies.</li></ul>",
